    "description": "Complete REST API for User Management System with JWT Authentication.\n\n**Updates:**\n- Adapted for 'password' column change (removed password_hash).\n- Added JWT Authorization headers to protected routes.\n\n**Features:**\n- User Registration & Authentication\n- CRUD Operations for Users\n- JWT Token Management\n- Input Validation\n- Error Handling",
